{"id":"n5-081","title":"すぐに～","romaji":"sugu ni～","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Immediately or right away; used to express promptness or quickness.","longExplanation":"The すぐに～ grammar point is used to express an action happening immediately or right away. It often indicates promptness or quickness and can be used with both verbs and adjectives.","formation":"すぐに + Verb/Adjective","examples":[{"jp":"友達が来たら、すぐに電話をかけてください。","romaji":"Tomodachi ga kitara, sugu ni denwa wo kakete kudasai.","en":"When my friend arrives, please call me right away.","words":[{"surface":"友達","vocabId":"1540170","reading":"ともだち"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来たら","vocabId":"1547720","reading":"きたら","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"電話","vocabId":"1443840","reading":"でんわ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"かけ","vocabId":"1590040","reading":"かけ","baseForm":"かける"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5]},{"jp":"そのニュースを聞いたら、すぐに会社に行きました。","romaji":"Sono nyuusu wo kiitara, sugu ni kaisha ni ikimashita.","en":"Upon hearing that news, I went to the company immediately.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ニュース","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"聞いたら","vocabId":"1591110","reading":"きいたら","baseForm":"聞く"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"会社","vocabId":"1198550","reading":"かいしゃ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行きました","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いきました","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6]},{"jp":"彼女はすぐに泣き出した。","romaji":"Kanojo wa sugu ni nakidashita.","en":"She started crying right away.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"泣き出した","vocabId":"1229840","reading":"なきだした","baseForm":"泣く"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3]},{"jp":"教室に入ると、先生はすぐに授業を始めた。","romaji":"Kyoushitsu ni hairu to, sensei wa sugu ni jugyou wo hajimeta.","en":"As soon as I entered the classroom, the teacher started the lesson immediately.","words":[{"surface":"教室","vocabId":"1237150","reading":"きょうしつ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"入ると","vocabId":"1465590","reading":"はいると","baseForm":"入る"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"先生","vocabId":"1387990","reading":"せんせい"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"授業","vocabId":"1330290","reading":"じゅぎょう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"始めた","vocabId":"1307550","reading":"はじめた","baseForm":"始める"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6,7]}],"kind":"construction"}